---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const seo = {
  title: "Arthavi AI — Ask Anything About Your Indian Portfolio | Mutual Fund & Stock Analysis",
  description: "Arthavi AI is India's first portfolio-aware investment assistant. Ask about XIRR, portfolio overlap, sector concentration, or benchmark comparisons. Get instant, data-driven answers about your real mutual funds and stocks.",
};
---
<Layout title={seo.title} description={seo.description}  schema={JSON.stringify({
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "Article",
      "headline": "Arthavi AI: India's First Portfolio-Aware Investment Assistant",
      "description": "Arthavi AI is a smart investment assistant embedded in the Arthavi portfolio tracker. It reads your actual mutual fund and stock data to answer questions about XIRR, portfolio overlap, sector risk, and benchmark comparisons.",
      "author": { "@type": "Organization", "name": "Arthavi", "url": "https://arthavi.com" },
      "publisher": { "@type": "Organization", "name": "Arthavi", "logo": { "@type": "ImageObject", "url": "https://arthavi.com/logo.png" } },
      "mainEntityOfPage": { "@type": "WebPage", "@id": "https://arthavi.com/ask-ai-investment-assistant.html" }
    })}>

    
    

    <main id="main-content">
        <!-- Hero -->
        <section class="ai-hero container">
            <div style="position: relative; z-index: 1;">
                <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
                    <span class="ai-badge">
                        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                            stroke-width="2">
                            <path
                                d="m12 3-1.912 5.813a2 2 0 0 1-1.275 1.275L3 12l5.813 1.912a2 2 0 0 1 1.275 1.275L12 21l1.912-5.813a2 2 0 0 1 1.275-1.275L21 12l-5.813-1.912a2 2 0 0 1-1.275-1.275Z" />
                        </svg>
                        Arthavi AI — Now Live
                    </span>
                </div>
                <h1>Chat with Your Portfolio.<br><span>Get Instant Investment Insights.</span></h1>
                <p>Arthavi AI is India's first portfolio-aware investment assistant. It reads your actual mutual fund
                    and stock holdings to give you real, data-driven answers — not generic advice.</p>

                <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center;">
                    <a href="https://app.arthavi.com/register" class="btn btn-primary"
                        style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1, #8b5cf6); box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(139,92,246,0.35);">
                        Create Free Account
                        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                            stroke-width="2" style="margin-left:8px">
                            <path d="M5 12h14" />
                            <path d="M12 5l7 7-7 7" />
                        </svg>
                    </a>
                </div>
                <p style="margin-top: 0.75rem;"><a href="https://app.arthavi.com/demo" class="demo-text-link">or try a demo portfolio →</a></p>
                <p style="margin-top: 1rem; font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--text-muted);">Free • No demat linking • No
                    broker credentials</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Live Demo Chat -->
            <div class="example-chat fade-in delay-200">
                <div class="chat-header">
                    <div class="chat-dot"></div>
                    <span class="chat-header-title">Arthavi AI</span>
                    <span style="margin-left: auto; font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--text-muted);">Reading your
                        portfolio...</span>
                </div>
                <div class="chat-messages">
                    <div class="msg user">My portfolio has 5 mutual funds. Do any of them overlap?</div>
                    <div class="msg ai-reply">
                        Yes — I found significant overlap. <strong>Mirae Asset Large Cap</strong> and <strong>Axis
                            Bluechip Fund</strong> have a <span class="wa">~72% stock overlap</span> because both track
                        Nifty 100 constituents. Their top common holdings are <strong>Reliance, HDFC Bank, and
                            Infosys</strong>.<br><br>
                        <strong>Parag Parikh Flexi Cap</strong> has minimal overlap with these two (only ~18%), which is
                        good for diversification. I'd suggest <strong>consolidating Axis Bluechip into Mirae</strong> or
                        replacing one with a mid/small-cap scheme.
                        <br><br>
                        <em style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted);">Note: This is not SEBI-registered
                            financial advice. Please consult a financial advisor before making major investment
                            decisions.</em>
                    </div>
                    <div class="msg user">Which of my stocks is dragging returns the most?</div>
                    <div class="msg ai-reply">
                        Based on your holdings, <strong class="lo">Zomato (−22% return)</strong> and <strong
                            class="lo">Paytm (−38% return)</strong> are your biggest underperformers. Together they
                        account for roughly <span class="wa">8% of your equity portfolio</span> but are dragging your
                        overall stock XIRR from ~14% down to ~9.8%.<br><br>
                        Your best performers are <strong class="hi">Tata Consultancy Services (+31%)</strong> and
                        <strong class="hi">Titan Company (+27%)</strong>. Want me to suggest any rebalancing strategy?
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Capabilities -->
        <section class="capabilities-section" id="capabilities">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="section-header text-center fade-in">
                    <h2>What You Can Ask Arthavi AI</h2>
                    <p class="section-sub">Arthavi AI is scoped specifically to Indian mutual funds and stocks. It has
                        read-only access to your portfolio data and can search the web for current market information.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="cap-grid">
                    <div class="cap-card fade-in delay-100">
                        <div class="cap-icon">
                            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                                stroke-width="2">
                                <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z" />
                                <polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8" />
                                <line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13" />
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <h3>Portfolio Overlap Analysis</h3>
                        <p>Find out if multiple mutual fund schemes you hold are investing in the same stocks, defeating
                            the purpose of diversification.</p>
                        <div class="cap-example">"Do my 5 mutual funds overlap with each other?"</div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="cap-card fade-in delay-200">
                        <div class="cap-icon">
                            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                                stroke-width="2">
                                <polyline points="23 6 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 1 18" />
                                <polyline points="17 6 23 6 23 12" />
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <h3>XIRR & Returns Analysis</h3>
                        <p>Get accurate XIRR calculations based on your actual SIPs, lumpsum investments, and
                            redemptions — not simplified averages.</p>
                        <div class="cap-example">"What is my XIRR for the last 3 years?"</div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="cap-card fade-in delay-300">
                        <div class="cap-icon">
                            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                                stroke-width="2">
                                <path d="M3 3v18h18" />
                                <path d="M18 9l-6-6-4 4-3 3" />
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <h3>Benchmark Comparison</h3>
                        <p>Compare your actual portfolio XIRR against Nifty 50, Nifty Midcap 150, or any index to
                            understand if you're beating the market.</p>
                        <div class="cap-example">"Am I beating Nifty 50 over 5 years?"</div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="cap-card fade-in delay-100">
                        <div class="cap-icon">
                            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                                stroke-width="2">
                                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" />
                                <path d="M12 8v4l3 3" />
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <h3>Sector Concentration Check</h3>
                        <p>Detect if you're overweight on any sector — Banking, IT, Pharma, Energy — across both your
                            mutual funds and direct stocks.</p>
                        <div class="cap-example">"Am I over-exposed to Banking & Finance?"</div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="cap-card fade-in delay-200">
                        <div class="cap-icon">
                            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                                stroke-width="2">
                                <rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2" />
                                <line x1="8" y1="21" x2="16" y2="21" />
                                <line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="21" />
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <h3>AMC Concentration Analysis</h3>
                        <p>Find out if you have too much exposure to a single AMC (like HDFC or SBI) and what
                            redistribution would look like.</p>
                        <div class="cap-example">"How much of my portfolio is with HDFC AMC?"</div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="cap-card fade-in delay-300">
                        <div class="cap-icon">
                            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                                stroke-width="2">
                                <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z" />
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <h3>Improvement Suggestions</h3>
                        <p>The AI suggests which fund categories might be missing from your portfolio — mid/small-cap,
                            debt, international — for better balance.</p>
                        <div class="cap-example">"How can I improve my portfolio diversification?"</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Sample Questions -->
        <section class="questions-section">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="section-header text-center fade-in">
                    <h2>Questions You Can Ask Right Now</h2>
                    <p class="section-sub">These are real capabilities of Arthavi AI — not sample prompts for a generic
                        AI.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="questions-grid fade-in delay-100">
                    <div class="q-chip"><span class="q-icon">✦</span>"What is my current net worth in mutual funds and
                        stocks?"</div>
                    <div class="q-chip"><span class="q-icon">✦</span>"Show me my top 5 performing mutual funds by XIRR."
                    </div>
                    <div class="q-chip"><span class="q-icon">✦</span>"Which mutual funds are tracking similar indices?"
                    </div>
                    <div class="q-chip"><span class="q-icon">✦</span>"What percentage of my portfolio is in small-cap?"
                    </div>
                    <div class="q-chip"><span class="q-icon">✦</span>"How is HDFC Flexi Cap Fund performing vs category
                        average?"</div>
                    <div class="q-chip"><span class="q-icon">✦</span>"Which stocks should I consider for long-term
                        investing?"</div>
                    <div class="q-chip"><span class="q-icon">✦</span>"Am I overweight on IT sector stocks?"</div>
                    <div class="q-chip"><span class="q-icon">✦</span>"Compare Nifty 50 vs my portfolio returns last 3
                        years."</div>
                    <div class="q-chip"><span class="q-icon">✦</span>"What is the debt to equity ratio in my portfolio?"
                    </div>
                    <div class="q-chip"><span class="q-icon">✦</span>"Which of my SIPs has the best return per rupee
                        invested?"</div>
                    <div class="q-chip"><span class="q-icon">✦</span>"How diversified is my portfolio across AMCs?"
                    </div>
                    <div class="q-chip"><span class="q-icon">✦</span>"Give me a summary of my portfolio health."</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Privacy in AI -->
        <section class="privacy-ai-section" id="ai-privacy">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="section-header text-center fade-in">
                    <h2>Privacy-First AI — Your Data Stays Yours</h2>
                    <p class="section-sub">We know the concern: "Is my financial data being sent to ChatGPT?" The answer
                        is no.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="privacy-split">
                    <div class="privacy-list fade-in">
                        <div class="privacy-item">
                            <div class="privacy-check">✓</div>
                            <div>
                                <strong>Read-Only Access</strong>
                                <p>Arthavi AI has read-only access to your portfolio. It cannot execute trades, redeem
                                    funds, or change settings.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="privacy-item">
                            <div class="privacy-check">✓</div>
                            <div>
                                <strong>No Training on Your Data</strong>
                                <p>Your portfolio data is never used to train AI models. Each query is processed in
                                    isolation for your session only.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="privacy-item">
                            <div class="privacy-check">✓</div>
                            <div>
                                <strong>Encrypted Transmission</strong>
                                <p>All data sent to the AI layer is encrypted with TLS. It follows the same
                                    privacy-first architecture as the rest of Arthavi.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="privacy-item">
                            <div class="privacy-check">✓</div>
                            <div>
                                <strong>You Control It</strong>
                                <p>AI features can be enabled or disabled at any time from your settings. No lock-in.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="scope-box fade-in delay-100">
                        <h3>What Arthavi AI Covers</h3>
                        <div class="scope-row">
                            <span class="scope-yes">✓</span>
                            <span>Indian Mutual Funds (all AMCs)</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="scope-row">
                            <span class="scope-yes">✓</span>
                            <span>NSE / BSE Listed Stocks</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="scope-row">
                            <span class="scope-yes">✓</span>
                            <span>Portfolio Overlap Analysis</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="scope-row">
                            <span class="scope-yes">✓</span>
                            <span>XIRR, Returns, Asset Allocation</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="scope-row">
                            <span class="scope-yes">✓</span>
                            <span>Market Trends via Web Search</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="scope-row">
                            <span class="scope-no">✗</span>
                            <span style="color: var(--text-muted);">Cryptocurrency</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="scope-row">
                            <span class="scope-no">✗</span>
                            <span style="color: var(--text-muted);">US Stocks / International Equities</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="scope-row">
                            <span class="scope-no">✗</span>
                            <span style="color: var(--text-muted);">Real Estate / Gold / PPF</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="scope-row">
                            <span class="scope-no">✗</span>
                            <span style="color: var(--text-muted);">Trade Execution (ever)</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- SEO Article -->
        <section class="seo-article">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="article-content fade-in">
                    <h2>Why Indian Investors Need a Portfolio-Aware AI</h2>
                    <p>Most Indian investors manage their money across multiple platforms — SIPs on Groww, direct equity
                        on Zerodha, and NPS through their employer. When it comes to understanding the full picture,
                        they're left manually calculating XIRR in Excel or guessing if they're over-diversified.</p>
                    <p><strong>Arthavi AI changes that.</strong> Unlike generic AI chatbots (ChatGPT, Gemini) that know
                        nothing about your portfolio, Arthavi AI has real-time access to your actual holdings through
                        secure, read-only API calls. When you ask "What is my XIRR for the last 5 years?", it doesn't
                        guess — it calculates using your transaction data.</p>

                    <h2>Portfolio Overlap: A Problem Most Investors Don't Know They Have</h2>
                    <p>A very common mistake among SIP investors in India is holding multiple large-cap mutual funds
                        that track the same Nifty 100 constituents. For example, <strong>Mirae Asset Large Cap</strong>
                        and <strong>Axis Bluechip Fund</strong> might have 70%+ stock overlap, meaning you're
                        effectively paying two expense ratios for the same exposure.</p>
                    <p>Arthavi AI can detect this automatically. You just need to ask: <em>"Do my mutual funds
                            overlap?"</em> and it analyzes the schemes' category, AMC, and known index tracking to flag
                        redundancy.</p>

                    <h2>Sector Concentration: The Hidden Portfolio Risk</h2>
                    <p>Many Indian investors are unknowingly overweight in <strong>Banking & Finance</strong> — both
                        through direct stocks (HDFC Bank, ICICI Bank) and through their mutual funds (which themselves
                        allocate heavily to financials). Arthavi AI can compute your total sector exposure across both
                        asset classes and flag if you're concentrated beyond healthy levels.</p>

                    <h2>Benchmark Comparison: Are You Actually Beating the Market?</h2>
                    <p>XIRR alone doesn't tell the full story. If your portfolio returned 12% XIRR but Nifty 50 returned
                        15% in the same period, you're actually underperforming. Arthavi AI fetches live benchmark data
                        and compares it with your calculated XIRR — so you know exactly where you stand.</p>

                    <h2>The Responsibility of AI in Finance</h2>
                    <p>Arthavi AI provides analytics, not advice. All AI-generated responses carry a brief disclaimer
                        reminding users that AI insights are informational and not a substitute for SEBI-registered
                        financial advice. We believe in empowering investors with data — not replacing professional
                        judgment with algorithms.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Final CTA -->
        <section class="cta-section">
            <div class="container cta-content fade-in">
                <h2>Start Chatting With Your Portfolio</h2>
                <div style="margin: 1.5rem 0 2.5rem;">
                    <p class="text-muted" style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Import your investments and add your stocks — then ask
                        Arthavi AI anything.</p>
                    <p style="color: var(--text-head);">No demat linking. No credit card. Completely free.</p>
                </div>
                <a href="https://app.arthavi.com/register" class="btn btn-primary"
                    style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1, #8b5cf6); box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(139,92,246,0.35);">
                    Create Free Account
                    <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
                        stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="margin-left:8px">
                        <path d="M5 12h14"></path>
                        <path d="M12 5l7 7-7 7"></path>
                    </svg>
                </a>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    

    

</Layout>
